\f1\b Job Description:
\f2\b0 \
We are seeking a highly skilled Data Engineer with 6 to 12 years of experience to join our dynamic team.\'a0The ideal candidate will have a strong background in data architecture,\'a0pipeline design,\'a0and data warehousing.\'a0This role requires a collaborative spirit,\'a0a problem-solving mindset,\'a0and a commitment to leveraging data to drive business insights and innovation.\

\f1\b Key Responsibilities:
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Design, develop, and maintain scalable and robust data pipelines to process, transform, and store data efficiently.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Collaborate with data scientists, analysts, and stakeholders to identify data requirements and translate them into technical specifications.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Ensure data integrity, quality, and accessibility by implementing best practices for data governance and management.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Optimize data processing workflows for performance, reliability, and cost-effectiveness.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Build and manage data warehousing solutions to support analytics and reporting initiatives.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Implement ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) processes using appropriate tools and technologies.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Conduct thorough testing and validation of data processes to ensure high-quality outputs.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Monitor, troubleshoot, and resolve data-related issues in a timely manner.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f3\fs32 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f2\fs40 Stay updated with the latest industry trends and technologies in data engineering.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

